OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start with outbreaks
OL,6,Fof rain, turning heavy at times. Rain
OL,7,Fwill gradually ease into the
OL,8,Fafternoon, with just a few light
OL,9,Foutbreaks possible at times. Remaining
OL,10,Flargely cloudy with a few brighter
OL,11,Fspells later. Warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying mostly cloudy
OL,14,Fovernight with a few spots of rain
OL,15,Fpossible at times. Another warm and
OL,16,Ffairly humid night across the country.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
