OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FLargely cloudy skies on Monday
OL,6,Fwith a few outbreaks of rain or
OL,7,Fdrizzle possible at times. Some warm
OL,8,Fand humid brighter spells also likely
OL,9,Fin the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FChangeable over the next few days and
OL,13,Ffeeling fresher. Sunshine and showers
OL,14,Fwill spread across the country and it
OL,15,Fwill turn increasingly breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
